  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI - Toure - Wutiko</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The job market in Senegal is competitive, and the number of job seekers is only growing. Aboubacar is creating Wutiko, (Find It, in Wolof), a job searching platform that will connect job seekers with companies experiencing vacancies in ways that are efficient and transparent for both parties.</narrative>
  </description>
